{"term": {"label": "心", "occurrences": 6, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-i", "title": "離婁上", "description": "孟子曰：「離婁之明，公輸子之巧，不以規矩，不能成方員：師曠之聰，不以六律，不能正五音；堯舜之道，不以仁政，不能平治天下。今有仁心仁聞而民不被其澤，不可法於後世者，不行先王之道也。\n「故曰，徒善不足以為政，徒法不能以自行。《詩》云：『不愆不忘，率由舊章。』遵先王之法而過者，未之有也。聖人既竭目力焉，繼之以規矩準繩，以為方"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "上", "id": "上"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "今", "id": "今"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "命", "id": "命"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "失", "id": "失"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "斯", "id": "斯"}, {"form": "既", "id": "既"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "治", "id": "治"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}, {"form": "養", "id": "養"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.8109302162163288, "source": "道", "target": "治"}, {"weight": 1.0986122886681098, "source": "道", "target": "上"}, {"weight": 0.11778303565638346, "source": "道", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 0.4054651081081644, "source": "道", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 0.504405055963068, "source": "失", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.336986519711378, "source": "失", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 1.9315214116032138, "source": "失", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 2.336986519711378, "source": "失", "target": "聞"}, {"weight": 0.03440142671733232, "source": "聞", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.3073671025302198, "source": "聞", "target": "今"}, {"weight": 1.461517782357478, "source": "聞", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 3.253277251585533, "source": "聞", "target": "養"}, {"weight": 0.3220834991691132, "source": "心", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.5950491749820008, "source": "心", "target": "今"}, {"weight": 2.4423470353692043, "source": "心", "target": "既"}, {"weight": 2.1546649629174235, "source": "心", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 1.461517782357478, "source": "心", "target": "斯"}, {"weight": 0.4054651081081644, "source": "心", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 0.9760099665757773, "source": "心", "target": "君"}, {